  "description": "We at Haro are so very proud to collaborate with the Godfather of Freestyle and founder of our own company Mr Bob Haro. Bob has been hands on right the way through this project, even designing the seat and pads with his timeless art. The 26\" Freestyler has been design to tribute Bob's original Freestyler look back in the early 80's. This new model for 2020 has been made from 6061 alloy, with the look at feel of the original Haro Freestyler with its twin top tube. Comes with our high end heat treated 48 spline Lineage cranks, Fusion DX pedals, sealed Mid BB and sealed internal headset. The recreation of the Haro Vector bar now in an 1 1/8\" finishes off this amazing collaboration.\n100% 6061 alloy twin top-tube Freestyler disc frame with integrated HT and MID BB shell\n100% chromoly fork with one piece CNC internal threaded steer tube and tapered legs\n100% chromoly 1 1/8\" Haro Vector bars\nHaro Lineage 3-piece cranks with Bob Haro 39T Spider sprocket\nHigh flange alloy sealed bearing double wall wheels\nKenda Kranium tires 26x2.1\" front/rear\nBob Haro cartoon adjustable padded seat with alloy post\nFPD pedals\nFull Bob Haro cartoon pad set\nHaro Team grips\nPromax mechanical disc brake",
